{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"500d605a967553b8","type":"text","text":"Daughter of a forgotten bloodline for centuries ago.\n\nAralia Lumiere is a being with the ability to twist and bend the strings of fate it self.\n\nCenturies ago there was a woman named Maelle who fully awakened this power her abilities rivaled the powers of the Gods. Maelle did not have an immense physical strength but her ability to rewrite that of  what was destiny and change the plans that the Gods had in mind for mortals was truly powerful. Some people believed that she must be a descendant of the Raven Queen others believe she's a practitioner of the arcane arts. But what is undeniable is the worth of the bloodline she carries. The ability to control fate is a power that the Arch Devil Asmodeus has been searching for since the dawn of time. During her life Maelle was often watched by a single raven whether it was hiding in a tree or perched on her shoulder they were always near by. Eventually she met the man called the Champion of Ravens Vax'Ildan, the two of them fell in love and he vowed to protect the power she wields from all forces including that of his matron. After a while Maelle and Vax had a child very shortly after Asmodeus sent forces from the hells in an attempt to take both Maelle and her child. After a battle that lasted for 3 days Vax single handedly fighting off hundreds of demons and devils he was slain alongside Maelle. Now nobody knows what happened to the Lumiere bloodline.\n","x":-220,"y":-30,"width":1145,"height":330},
		{"id":"805de30049693e13","type":"text","text":"[[Aralia Lumiere.canvas]]\n#PlayerCharacter ","x":-220,"y":-140,"width":250,"height":60},
